Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 18:13:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Support system libs on Linux

---
 README.md                                     |  11 +
 .../cmake-includes/modules/FindGLM.cmake      | 138 ++++++++++
 .../cmake-includes/modules/FindImGui.cmake    | 244 ++++++++++++++++++
 buildsystem/linux-dynamic/CMakeLists.txt      | 142 ++++++++--
